      "description": "Normalized token types summed across harnesses: input · cache read (claude cacheRead / codex cached_input / opencode cachedInputTokens) · output · reasoning (codex reasoning_output / opencode reasoningTokens; claude folds reasoning into output).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 20 },
