      "id": 19,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Error Rate by Harness",
      "description": "claude = api_error / api_request · opencode = span-ERROR LLM calls / total calls. Codex emits no API-error counter (tool failures only) — its absence here is a coverage gap, not a zero.",
